<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SGS-Thomson started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SGS-Thomson started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said analyst Rajiv Chaudhri initiated coverage of SGS-Thomson Microelectronics NV with a market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- ADRs fell 3/4 to 78-5/8.</p>
